  "rules": [
    "Read the normative criterion at the pinned source; this register is an assignment, not replacement text.",
    "Every session records an evidence-backed disposition for all 50 IDs, with both local judges reviewing applicable obligations.",
    "NOT_APPLICABLE requires a scope-based reason, never missing implementation, missing evidence or an inconvenient gate.",
    "DEFERRED_TO_INTEGRATION names an exact global-only obligation, root as owner and dependency; it cannot move local work to root.",
    "S4 supplies shared Atlas implementation evidence; each domain owns its real usage evidence.",
    "Local dispositions do not waive a global criterion. Root and its two independent judges review the exact integrated union.",
    "A request for evidence remains HOLD until resolved; UNASSESSED is an initialization state, never a delivered verdict.",
    "Separate local_status from global_status. DEFERRED_TO_INTEGRATION may only describe the exact global_complement; a missing local importer, consumer, runtime proof or CI gate remains local HOLD."
